=head2 content

  my $str = $dom->content;
  $dom    = $dom->content('<p>I ♥ Mojolicious!</p>');
  $dom    = $dom->content(Mojo::DOM->new);

Return this node's content or replace it with HTML/XML fragment (for C<root> and C<tag> nodes) or raw content.

  # "<b>Test</b>"
