  $dom = $dom->wrap_content('<div></div>');
  $dom = $dom->wrap_content(Mojo::DOM->new);

Wrap HTML/XML fragment around this node's content (for C<root> and C<tag> nodes), placing it as the last children of
the first innermost element.

