=head2 remove

  Mojo::IOLoop->remove($id);
  $loop->remove($id);

Remove anything with an id, connections will be dropped gracefully by allowing them to finish writing all data in their
write buffers.

=head2 reset

  Mojo::IOLoop->reset;
  $loop->reset;
