    Some data!
  <% end %>

=head2 capture_start

  my $start = $mt->capture_start;
  $mt       = $mt->capture_start('begin');

Keyword indicating the start of a capture block, defaults to C<begin>.

  <% my $block = begin %>
    Some data!
  <% end %>

