  my $code = $mt->code;
  $mt      = $mt->code($code);

Perl code for template if available.

=head2 comment_mark

  my $mark = $mt->comment_mark;
  $mt      = $mt->comment_mark('#');

Character indicating the start of a comment, defaults to C<#>.

  <%# This is a comment %>

=head2 compiled

  my $compiled = $mt->compiled;
