=head2 encoding

  my $encoding = $mt->encoding;
  $mt          = $mt->encoding('UTF-8');

Encoding used for template files, defaults to C<UTF-8>.

=head2 escape

  my $cb = $mt->escape;
  $mt    = $mt->escape(sub {...});

