=head1 METHODS

L<Mojo::UserAgent> inherits all methods from L<Mojo::EventEmitter> and implements the following new ones.

=head2 build_tx

  my $tx = $ua->build_tx(GET => 'example.com');
  my $tx = $ua->build_tx(PUT => 'http://example.com' => {Accept => '*/*'} => 'Content!');
