=head2 upgrade

  my $tx = $t->upgrade(Mojo::Transaction::HTTP->new);

Build L<Mojo::Transaction::WebSocket> follow-up transaction for WebSocket handshake if possible.

=head2 websocket

  my $tx = $t->websocket('ws://example.com');
