  # Render template from application
  my $foo = $app->build_controller->render_to_string(template => 'foo');

=head2 build_tx

  my $tx = $app->build_tx;

Build L<Mojo::Transaction::HTTP> object and emit L</"after_build_tx"> hook.

=head2 config

  my $hash = $app->config;
