Allow L</"under"> semantics for this route.

=head2 parent

  my $parent = $r->parent;
  $r         = $r->parent(Mojolicious::Routes::Route->new);

The parent of this route, usually a L<Mojolicious::Routes::Route> object. Note that this attribute is weakened.

=head2 partial

  my $bool = $r->partial;
