  $t = $t->finish_ok(1003 => 'Cannot accept data!');

Close WebSocket connection gracefully.

=head2 finished_ok

  $t = $t->finished_ok(1000);

Wait for WebSocket connection to be closed gracefully and check status.

=head2 get_ok

  $t = $t->get_ok('http://example.com/foo');
